  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（デジカメの容量、足りなくなっちゃいそう……。いちど新聞部の部室に戻って、取り替えないと。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（でも、もうじき『新入生懇親会』は終わっちゃいますよね？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（もう放課後の、だいぶ遅い時間ですし。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（お客さんたちは帰っちゃう刻限ですぅ、でも生徒には後片付けとかありますしね？）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（準備や後片付けも含めて、青春のいちぶですぅ。ぜんぶ、写真におさめちゃいますよ。）"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 26,
    "dress": "old-new",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-new_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ひよの",
    "text": "（平穏無事に終わっちゃう感じで、新聞記事にするとき苦労しそうですけど）"
